[{"answer":"Hi, Rob. How's the course going?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, hi, Mia. Yeah, great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I can't believe the first term's nearly over.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I saw your group's performance last night at the student theatre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/4.mp3"},{"answer":"It was good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah... but now we have to write a report on the whole thing, an in-depth analysis.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know where to start.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Like, I have to write about the role I played, the doctor, how I developed the character.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, what was your starting point?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/10.mp3"},{"answer":"My grandfather was a doctor before he retired, and I just based it on him.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/11.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, but how?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you talk to him about it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/13.mp3"},{"answer":"He must have all sorts of stories, but he never says much about his work, even now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/14.mp3"},{"answer":"He has a sort of authority though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/15.mp3"},{"answer":"So how did you manage to capture that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd visualise what he must have been like in the past,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/17.mp3"},{"answer":"when he was sitting in his consulting room listening to his patients.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/18.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, so that's what you explain in your report.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there's the issue of atmosphere -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/21.mp3"},{"answer":"so in the first scene we needed to know how boring life was in the doctor's village in the 1950s,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/22.mp3"},{"answer":"so when the curtain went up on the first scene in the waiting room,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/23.mp3"},{"answer":"there was that long silence before anyone spoke.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/24.mp3"},{"answer":"And then people kept saying the same thing over and over, like 'Cold, isn't it?'","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, and everyone wore grey and brown, and just sat in a row.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, all those details of the production.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/27.mp3"},{"answer":"And I have to analyse how I functioned in the group -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/28.mp3"},{"answer":"what I found out about myself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I know I was so frustrated at times, when we couldn't agree.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. So did one person emerge as the leader?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Sophia did.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/32.mp3"},{"answer":"That was OK - she helped us work out exactly what to do, for the production.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/33.mp3"},{"answer":"And that made me feel better, I suppose.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/34.mp3"},{"answer":"When you understood what needed doing?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/36.mp3"},{"answer":"And Sophia did some research, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/37.mp3"},{"answer":"That was useful in developing our approach.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Like what?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, she found these articles from the 1950s about how relationships between children and their parents,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/40.mp3"},{"answer":"or between the public and people like bank managers or the police were shifting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/42.mp3"},{"answer":"And did you have any practical problems to overcome?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, in the final rehearsal everything was going fine until the last scene -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/44.mp3"},{"answer":"that's where the doctor's first patient appears on stage on his own.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/45.mp3"},{"answer":"The one in the wheelchair?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, and he had this really long speech, with the stage all dark except for one spotlight -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/47.mp3"},{"answer":"and then that stuck somehow so it was shining on the wrong side of the stage...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/48.mp3"},{"answer":"but anyway we got that fixed, thank goodness.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it was fine on the night.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/50.mp3"},{"answer":"But while you're here, Mia.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I wanted to ask you about the year abroad option.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Would you recommend doing that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, definitely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/54.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a fantastic chance to study in another country for a year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I'd like to do it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/56.mp3"},{"answer":"but it looks very competitive -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/57.mp3"},{"answer":"there's only a limited number of places.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, so next year when you are in the second year of the course,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/59.mp3"},{"answer":"you need to work really hard in all your theatre studies modules.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Only students with good marks get places -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/61.mp3"},{"answer":"you have to prove that you know your subject really well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/63.mp3"},{"answer":"So how did you choose where to go?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I decided I wanted a programme that would fit in with what I wanted to do after I graduate,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/65.mp3"},{"answer":"so I looked for a university with emphasis on acting rather than directing for example.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/66.mp3"},{"answer":"It depends on you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Then about six months before you go,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/68.mp3"},{"answer":"you have to email the scheme coordinator with your top three choices.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I had a friend who missed the deadline and didn't get her first choice,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/70.mp3"},{"answer":"so you do need to get a move on at that stage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/71.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll find that certain places are very popular with everyone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/72.mp3"},{"answer":"And don't you have to write a personal statement at that stage?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/75.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll get some of the final year students to give me some tips...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/76.mp3"},{"answer":"maybe see if I can read what they wrote.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/77.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that's a very good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/78.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't mind showing you what I did.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/79.mp3"},{"answer":"And while you're abroad don't make the mistake I made.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/80.mp3"},{"answer":"I got so involved I forgot all about making arrangements for when I came back here for the final year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Make sure you stay in touch so they know your choices for the optional modules.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/82.mp3"},{"answer":"You don't want to miss out doing your preferred specialisms.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-3-2023-06-14-12-31-23/84.mp3"}]
